// Package modelcatalog owns the Caelis application model directory and resolves
// provider/model identifiers into capabilities used to assemble SDK model
// instances. Concrete model metadata belongs here rather than in agent-sdk.
//
// The embedded compact snapshot is generated by internal/generate. To refresh
// only OpenRouter, save https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models as a local JSON file
// and run that generator with -openrouter-input=<file> and the existing snapshot
// as -output. This preserves other providers and historical ID lookup, hiding
// routes absent from the source or unsuitable for chat with tools. It imports
// endpoint reasoning controls rather than inferring them from the vendor name.
package modelcatalog
